  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e03-scene-02",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "法庭上见  (See You in Court)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "agent": "经纪人",
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 3 of Behind the Scenes. After diva Xin Huimei walked off Twelve Singers, her manager urges her not to fall out with Yuanye Records, only for Huimei to expose their secret plan. Listen to their Mandarin conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "惠美，我劝你别闹了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你跟公司撕破脸，对谁也没有好处。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你们的偷袭计划没成功，现在来劝我回头了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "什么偷袭计划？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "原野公司不是派你去星天获得视频资料吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你们想搜集我违约的证据打官司吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你做我经纪人这么多年，没想到会做出这种事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我这么做是为了不让你跟公司闹掰。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "解约的事，律师团队已经起诉了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你跟公司是有合约的，你也得赔偿违约金。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "法庭上见吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "惠美，我劝你别闹了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Huimei, I advise you to stop making a scene.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你跟公司撕破脸，对谁也没有好处。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Falling out with the company does nobody any good.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你们的偷袭计划没成功，现在来劝我回头了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your ambush plan failed, and now you come telling me to turn back?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "什么偷袭计划？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What ambush plan?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "原野公司不是派你去星天获得视频资料吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did Yuanye not send you to Xingtian to get video footage?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你们想搜集我违约的证据打官司吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You wanted to gather proof I broke my contract for a lawsuit, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你做我经纪人这么多年，没想到会做出这种事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You were my manager for so many years, yet I never thought you would do this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我这么做是为了不让你跟公司闹掰。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I did this so you would not break up with the company.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "解约的事，律师团队已经起诉了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As for ending the contract, my legal team has already filed a lawsuit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你跟公司是有合约的，你也得赔偿违约金。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have a contract with the company, so you will still owe penalty fees.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "法庭上见吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'See you in court.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "惠美，我劝你别闹了。",
      "gap": 0.5
