      "t": "解约的事，律师团队已经起诉了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你跟公司是有合约的，你也得赔偿违约金。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "法庭上见吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Huimei refuses to back down and tells her manager she will see the label in court. Keep listening as the fallout reaches Xingtian. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
